customer: young_entrepreneur
problem: gpu_overheating
brief:
	The deletion event. A Win95 [x] floats over him all of day 6, also when he picks up, and only that day. A click deletes him: he and his computer vanish (also from the counter) and are never mentioned again, except at the end. His voice glitches with Cambion.

== drop-off
(irritated02) I didn't think we'd meet again so soon but as you understand there are things hindering my way to the millions.
- What's wrong this time?
- Millions? Of... dollars?
(problem) Just start it and you'll see what's wrong.
(irritated03) Everything is glitching and it just disturbs my workflow!
- Okay, I'll take a look!
(happy) Great! And as I like to say...
- Time is money. Yeah, I know, I know.

== pick-up
(angry) Give me that! I have no time to waste! Fame and fortune awaits!
- Woha! Take it easy man. I've fixed the error.
- I think I found the issue. It should work now.
(irritated03) I sure hope so because I have no time for these technical shenanigans trying to deprive me of my glorious future.
- ...
(irritated03) TIME IS MONEY!!!
- ...bye.
